      {
        "id": "chapter-position",
        "moduleId": "why-runtime-store",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "本章定位：过程与局部性",
        "markdown": "本章讨论**过程（procedure，又称子程序 subroutine）与局部性**。过程是组织程序最重要的工具之一，因此它的实现必须高效。本知识点聚焦一个具体问题：过程调用发生时，返回地址与局部变量放在内存的什么位置，以及这些存储块如何分配与回收。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-babef9366a304ec14e46e038",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000051"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "12. Procedures and the Concept of Locality"
              ],
              "lineStart": 444,
              "lineEnd": 445,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "c64e1fae187c5599680c853418cadeb6ddedc1c40814b186b8d695fd416d27c2"
            },
            {
              "materialId": "doc-babef9366a304ec14e46e038",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000052"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "12. Procedures and the Concept of Locality",
                "Run-time organization of the store"
              ],
